flowchart LR
Browser[Thymeleaf browser + JS] --> Gateway[Node same-origin gateway]
Gateway --> MVC[Spring REST / MVC]
Gateway --> WS[Spring WebSocket / STOMP]
MVC --> Services[Transactional application services]
WS --> Services
Services --> Repo[JPA repositories]
Repo --> SQL[(PostgreSQL)]
Services --> Storage[StoragePort / S3 adapter]
Storage --> Objects[(Object storage)]
Services --> Events[Domain events]
Events --> Notifications[Notification observer]
Notifications --> WS
Gateway --> TURNAPI[Cloudflare temporary credential API]
Browser <-->|WebRTC media| Peers[Peer browsers / TURN relay]
